{
  "_about": "Music School Phase 1, step 1 (Nov 1 overrides): the child's music level (ML 1-5) and the quiet game dials. Pure data for musiclevel.js. No age prior: everyone starts from a neutral ML2, the hatching-song warm-up sets the start, then play adapts toward ~70-80% success. The child never sees a level, a number or a score.",
  "v": 1,
  "levels": {
